                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Dudley to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Lima</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1904-05-07"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">May 7, 1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>President Candamo died this morning at Arequipa.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dudley.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
